# ✨ The image is public. Nothing reaches the build unless it is named here, so a .env, a database dump or
# a private pathway left in the working directory cannot end up in it.
#
# Named after the Dockerfile, so that it applies to that build alone. A plain .dockerignore here would also
# hide the devcontainer's own files from the devcontainer's build, whose context is this same directory.
*

!requirements.txt
!manage.py
!gunicorn.conf.py
!config/
!access/
!engine/
!pathways/
!frontend/

frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
